    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38">

                <pb facs="0140" n="41" sameAs="frus:frus1936v05/pg41"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/372: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-07T16:00:00-03:00">February 7, 1936—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. From Braden. By resolution adopted February 3, special repatriation
                    commission of one officer from each mediatory nation is being set up to
                    supervise repatriation of prisoners under terms of January 21st agreement.
                    Request authorization for designation of Sharp<anchor n="14" xml:id="d38-f1"/>
                    as American member. Duties should be completed within 3 months. [Braden.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d38-f1" n="14" xml:id="d38-f1-content">
                <p>Captain Frederick Dent Sharp, Military Attaché in Argentina.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
